+## Keys and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are `apiKeys: [{ key, name, role }]`
+in the data. Roles: `viewer` (GET only), `cook` (also cook, waste,
+temperatures, stock-take counts), `manager` (everything). No or unknown key
+is `unauthorized` (401); a known key without permission is `forbidden` (403).
+
+Each non-GET request with a known key is written to the audit trail (time,
+key name, method, path, status); `GET /audit` lists it, newest first, for
+managers only.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
